# Universal Credits Protocol

## The one rule

**`1 UC = $1.00 USD`** (fixed, always).

## Before touching any credit/payment code

1. Read `@docs/protocols/UNIVERSAL_CREDITS_PROTOCOL.md`.
2. **Never hardcode rates or credit values.** Fetch them:
   - Exchange rates: `GET https://fullpotential.ai/services/credits/api/exchange-rates`
   - Pricing: `GET https://fullpotential.ai/services/credits/api/pricing`
3. **Authority:** FP Credits Gateway, port 8765. All mutations go through it.

## Credit types (all 1:1 with USD)

- **UC** (Universal Credit) — primary, use this.
- FPC, CORA, SKY, FI — historical aliases, equivalent.

## Deprecated — DO NOT USE

POT · COMPUTE · CONTENT · FPAI · CHURCH. Rename to UC on sight.

Related: `@docs/protocols/UC_QUICK_REFERENCE.md`.
